WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:07.215
Homework is how you choose what your class practises. Students see it on their home screen,

00:07.215 --> 00:09.207
and they can do it offline.

00:09.657 --> 00:15.642
Each assigned unit can have a start date, a due date, and a number of questions.

00:15.642 --> 00:20.803
Without a number, a unit is done when the student reaches Proficient.

00:21.253 --> 00:29.194
To add a unit, pick it from Add a unit. Or choose Pick several units at once to assign a whole set.

00:29.644 --> 00:34.799
Choose the whole class, or pick certain students, then tap Assign.

00:35.249 --> 00:42.800
Not sure about a unit? Tap Preview, or Try it, to play its first questions as a student would.

00:42.800 --> 00:44.166
Nothing is saved.
